        "ActorTalk": "Sure.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 4,
        "ActorName": "Female Student",
        "ActorTalk": "I've been doing simulated combat recently, trying to achieve the best results possible in classic battle simulations.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 5,
        "ActorName": "Female Student",
        "ActorTalk": "But it hasn't been going well, so I wanted to ask\u2014in your eyes, what's the one thing that we should absolutely believe in and uphold when we're on the battlefield?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 6,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "Trust your comrades.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 7,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "Believe in yourself.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 8,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "Trust in Black Cards",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 9,
        "ActorName": "\u3010kuroname\u3011",
        "ActorTalk": "I'll think about it.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 10,
        "ActorName": "Female Student",
        "ActorTalk": "Trusting your comrades... means letting them handle what you're not good at, right?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 11,
        "ActorName": "Female Student",
        "ActorTalk": "But that would mean admitting my own weakness... I'll give it a try anyway.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 12,
        "ActorName": "Female Student",
        "ActorTalk": "Thank you.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 13,
        "ActorName": "Female Student",
        "ActorTalk": "Believe in myself, huh... So, when you're on the battlefield, what's really important is confidence and morale\u2014is that what you're saying?",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 14,
        "ActorName": "Female Student",
        "ActorTalk": "It's true. I'm often hesitant and afraid to make decisions.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 15,
        "ActorName": "Female Student",
        "ActorTalk": "Next time... I'll believe in myself more. Thank you.",
        "Cv": null,
